      "content": "that sounds nice but it's just empty words. empathy and ethics dont pay the rent or give me a reason to wake up. in the real world, value is about what you can produce and do. if i'm not producing anything of value anymore, then i'm just a drain on everything around me. it's like being a dead battery in a circuit. eventually, you just have to accept that you're part of the waste.",
